WEBVTT

00:00:00.930 --> 00:00:03.080
Here I go!

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:04.980
Yay!

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:08.860
Inuzuka-san, it must be hard for you, 
with your work and all.

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:13.800
No, I manage to get by with the help 
of babysitters and my friends.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:16.200
Tsumugi helps out a lot, too.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:19.180
You don't get a lot of time to rest, do you?

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:21.080
You have to make lunches and all.

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:22.890
Well...

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:26.550
I never really slept that much anyway.

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:29.950
I wake up after about four hours.

00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:31.980
I don't know where you get the energy!

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:35.790
If I'm not careful, I can sleep all day.

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:38.600
Well, I'm used to it by now.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.480
Daddy?

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:50.400
You okay?

00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:29.500
<b>Gohei Mochi and a Grand Adventure</b>

00:02:30.820 --> 00:02:33.030
Sorry, Tsumugi...

00:02:34.070 --> 00:02:37.300
Daddy's not feeling well.

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:39.960
Would you go to the living room?

00:02:40.790 --> 00:02:41.890
Okay!

00:02:49.190 --> 00:02:50.960
I can see you.

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:52.270
Okay!

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:03.990
There's jelly in the fridge.

00:03:05.380 --> 00:03:06.990
Let's eat it together.

00:03:07.430 --> 00:03:08.170
Okay!

00:03:12.390 --> 00:03:13.960
Come out,

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:15.190
jelly!

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.300
Jelly...

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:37.440
Daddy!

00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:40.090
There's no jelly!

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:42.970
There's none!

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:44.790
Sorry...

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:48.420
I'll go buy some when I'm feeling better.

00:03:49.170 --> 00:03:51.620
I'm gonna take a nap for a bit.

00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:52.740
Sorry.

00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:58.570
Daddy?

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:15.560
<b>Magi-Girl</b>

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:15.560
<i>I'm going to save everyone!</i>

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:18.400
<i>No matter how difficult it may be!</i>

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:22.360
<i>Yoshiko-chan!</i>

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:25.200
<i>Put your hand into my fluff!</i>

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:27.180
<i>Hooray! Fluffy-fluff!</i>

00:04:27.180 --> 00:04:28.830
<i>Got it, Mr. Galigali!</i>

00:04:32.280 --> 00:04:34.870
<i>Come here, my friend!</i>

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:38.340
<i>Lend me your power, my Magi-Girl!</i>

00:04:42.810 --> 00:04:44.800
<i>Super Magic Explosion!</i>

00:04:46.750 --> 00:04:49.810
<i>Physical! Magi-Girl! Here I come!</i>

00:05:01.190 --> 00:05:02.610
<b>Magi-Girl</b>

00:06:03.450 --> 00:06:04.660
This way!

00:06:06.810 --> 00:06:08.830
Higher! Push me higher!

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:11.280
Okay, hang on tight!

00:06:11.280 --> 00:06:12.220
Okay!

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:13.560
Here we go! How's that?

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:14.980
Whee!

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:23.580
Sharks! Sharks! Sharks, sharks!

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:26.790
Watch out for sharks!

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:30.870
Sharks! Sharks! Sharks, sharks!

00:06:32.390 --> 00:06:34.110
Watch out for them!

00:06:34.110 --> 00:06:34.950
Shark!

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:42.460
Shark-shark! I don't wanna meet no sharks!

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:44.220
Sharky-sharky shark!

00:06:44.220 --> 00:06:47.460
Sharky-sharky-sharky-sharky shark!

00:06:47.790 --> 00:06:49.420
Shark shark!

00:06:47.790 --> 00:06:49.420
What's she doing?

00:06:49.420 --> 00:06:50.720
She's so cute!

00:06:49.420 --> 00:06:52.730
Sharks! Sharks! Sharks, sharks!

00:06:53.540 --> 00:06:55.900
Watch out for sharks!

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:07.990
Sharks...

00:07:09.690 --> 00:07:11.450
Watch out for sharks.

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:12.720
Here we go!

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:13.690
Okay!

00:07:13.690 --> 00:07:15.160
Ready... go!

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:16.370
There we go!

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:23.500
Bye-bye!

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:25.210
Bye-bye!

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:28.710
Sharks! Sharks! Sharks, sharks!

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:31.860
Watch out for sharks!

00:07:52.310 --> 00:07:53.450
You okay?

00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:58.370
Hey, Bear! Stop it!

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:01.830
Good doggy!

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:30.110
<b>Magi-Girl Show!!</b>

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:30.110
You might see 
Mr. Galigali, too!

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:38.880
Look right. Look left.

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:41.750
Look right. Look left.

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:44.410
Right, right. Left!

00:08:44.410 --> 00:08:46.620
Right! Left!

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:47.710
Right!

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:50.050
Want to cross with me?

00:08:51.280 --> 00:08:52.210
Okay!

00:08:52.600 --> 00:08:55.950
It's hot!

00:08:55.950 --> 00:09:01.680
There are cicadas, and it's hot!

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:03.290
Bye-bye!

00:09:03.290 --> 00:09:04.140
Bye!

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:06.140
<b>Skip Road</b>

00:09:06.140 --> 00:09:09.530
It's hot!

00:09:09.530 --> 00:09:10.700
Yup! Yup!

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:12.150
It's hot...

00:09:24.260 --> 00:09:28.630
It's hot! Yup! Yup!

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:32.720
Yup! It's summer! Summer!

00:09:32.720 --> 00:09:33.620
Ice cream!

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:37.860
Watch it!

00:09:38.290 --> 00:09:39.690
Sheesh!

00:10:17.360 --> 00:10:18.260
Tsumugi?

00:10:37.730 --> 00:10:38.820
Tsumugi!

00:11:01.520 --> 00:11:03.430
H-Hello!

00:11:03.840 --> 00:11:05.630
Hello!

00:11:05.630 --> 00:11:07.390
Kotori-chan!

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:12.860
Kotori-chan!

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:16.380
Open up!

00:11:20.420 --> 00:11:21.530
Tsumugi-chan?

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:26.490
What's wrong?

00:11:26.490 --> 00:11:28.460
Wait there. I'll be right down!

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:47.900
Inuzuka-sensei's sick?

00:11:47.900 --> 00:11:48.810
Uh-huh.

00:11:53.170 --> 00:11:54.230
He's asleep.

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:55.590
Oh, no!

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:06.780
<b>Orange Jelly</b>

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:06.780
Jelly, a sports drink,

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:09.320
and I'll put some medicine in here, too.

00:12:09.320 --> 00:12:10.390
Okay.

00:12:10.390 --> 00:12:12.760
Is there any food I can send?

00:12:19.350 --> 00:12:20.400
Know what?

00:12:21.520 --> 00:12:24.050
I didn't cry!

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:27.260
Am I a good girl?

00:12:29.860 --> 00:12:31.560
Yup, you're a good girl.

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:34.040
That's great, Tsumugi-chan!

00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:34.680
Yup!

00:12:35.240 --> 00:12:36.020
I know.

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:38.020
<b>White Peaches</b>

00:12:36.660 --> 00:12:37.620
Here.

00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:40.470
I'll put these in.

00:12:41.830 --> 00:12:44.320
The special ones for when you get a cold!

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:46.280
Special?

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:49.740
When I get a cold, Daddy buys them for me!

00:12:50.230 --> 00:12:51.530
I see.

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:55.120
I always eat canned peaches 
when I have a cold, too.

00:13:03.680 --> 00:13:05.190
Listen, Tsumugi-chan...

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:09.620
I can only bring you back 
to close to your house.

00:13:09.620 --> 00:13:11.770
Can you go the rest of the way on your own?

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:13.160
Sure!

00:13:13.160 --> 00:13:15.220
I can go anywhere!

00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:16.920
All right.

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:25.030
Daddy!

00:13:25.960 --> 00:13:26.990
Tsumugi!

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:29.240
Daddy!

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:31.960
Are you all better now?

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:36.010
Don't leave the house by yourself!

00:13:56.660 --> 00:13:58.240
No!

00:13:58.240 --> 00:13:59.290
Tsumugi!

00:13:59.290 --> 00:14:01.370
Stop!

00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:03.340
You just disappeared,

00:14:03.340 --> 00:14:05.110
and I was so worried!

00:14:05.710 --> 00:14:07.700
Um, Sensei...

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:11.800
Tsumugi-chan, um...

00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:13.690
She was so worried about you,

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:16.540
she did her best by herself to come see me.

00:14:21.440 --> 00:14:24.050
I'm sorry for the trouble.

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:25.420
We'll be going home for today.

00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:27.050
I'll talk to you later.

00:14:27.050 --> 00:14:28.570
Um... Here...

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:31.480
Tsumugi!

00:14:31.480 --> 00:14:33.510
No!

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:35.340
I don't wanna go home!

00:14:35.340 --> 00:14:36.310
Let go of her!

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:38.730
No!

00:14:39.880 --> 00:14:42.320
Um... Would you like to come to the restaurant?

00:14:42.320 --> 00:14:45.670
No, we're going home for today!

00:14:45.670 --> 00:14:46.570
Tsumugi!

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:49.080
Tsumugi!

00:14:49.080 --> 00:14:52.200
Sensei, I don't know if you should force her...

00:14:57.700 --> 00:14:58.840
Sorry. Thanks.

00:15:09.330 --> 00:15:12.470
Um, would you like some rice before you go?

00:15:12.470 --> 00:15:16.500
My mom washed it. I just have to cook it now.

00:15:17.140 --> 00:15:19.580
Thanks, but we're all right.

00:15:21.090 --> 00:15:22.600
Would rice porridge be better?

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:24.150
It's okay.

00:15:24.530 --> 00:15:27.400
My fever wasn't that high.

00:15:28.920 --> 00:15:31.360
I'll just start cooking the rice, then.

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:35.880
I have to do something. 
I have to do something.

00:15:35.880 --> 00:15:37.620
I have to do something. 
I have to do something!

00:15:37.900 --> 00:15:40.640
I make delicious rice. They eat it together.

00:15:40.640 --> 00:15:42.650
They say, "It's good!" and make up.

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:44.880
Yes, it's the only way.

00:15:54.790 --> 00:15:58.020
I'm sorry for yelling so loudly.

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:06.950
But Daddy was so worried

00:16:07.430 --> 00:16:09.210
when you disappeared.

00:16:12.440 --> 00:16:17.450
Can you promise you won't just 
leave on your own anymore?

00:16:22.760 --> 00:16:24.460
I'm sorry.

00:16:26.850 --> 00:16:27.560
Okay.

00:16:35.480 --> 00:16:37.930
You were sick, right?

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:42.390
You were sick, right, Daddy?

00:16:44.630 --> 00:16:45.600
Yeah.

00:16:50.470 --> 00:16:53.080
I'm sorry for worrying you.

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:54.260
Uh-huh.

00:16:58.850 --> 00:17:00.200
You had a rough time, huh?

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:01.820
Uh-huh.

00:17:03.320 --> 00:17:04.640
You tried really hard, huh?

00:17:04.640 --> 00:17:05.300
Uh-huh.

00:17:07.220 --> 00:17:08.220
Thank you.

00:17:09.110 --> 00:17:09.860
Uh-huh.

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:16.870
What's wrong?

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:18.640
It...

00:17:19.590 --> 00:17:21.060
It's burnt...

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:31.650
It's so hard...

00:17:32.340 --> 00:17:35.960
Don't worry. It's okay if it's a little hard.

00:17:35.960 --> 00:17:38.120
I wanted to make it extra delicious,

00:17:38.850 --> 00:17:41.030
so you both would say

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:43.510
it was really good.

00:17:43.510 --> 00:17:46.300
That was what I wanted, but... Now what?

00:17:46.770 --> 00:17:48.000
We can't eat it?

00:17:51.030 --> 00:17:53.300
Um, it's okay.

00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:56.180
We can eat it if we just 
avoid the burnt parts.

00:17:57.560 --> 00:17:59.450
Why don't we make Gohei mochi?

00:18:00.040 --> 00:18:01.280
Gohei mochi?

00:18:01.280 --> 00:18:04.060
You knead the rice and grill it!

00:18:04.360 --> 00:18:05.850
Knead the rice and grill it...

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:06.520
Yes!

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:09.580
But I don't know how to make it...

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:11.230
It was a long, long time ago,

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:13.020
but I made it once.

00:18:13.720 --> 00:18:18.940
Some rice had gotten hard, and my dad 
and I didn't want it to go to waste.

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:23.620
So leave this one to me!

00:18:28.130 --> 00:18:30.120
What are those?

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:31.350
Walnuts.

00:18:31.350 --> 00:18:32.190
Walnuts?

00:18:32.190 --> 00:18:32.780
Yes.

00:18:32.780 --> 00:18:34.710
First we grind these.

00:18:40.580 --> 00:18:42.300
What are you doing?

00:18:43.190 --> 00:18:44.260
Making the sauce.

00:18:44.740 --> 00:18:46.970
Sauce? For yakiniku?

00:18:46.970 --> 00:18:48.310
Nope.

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:52.110
Once it's finely ground,
add white sesame seeds,

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:53.830
and then grind some more.

00:18:54.840 --> 00:18:57.070
Then add one tablespoon of miso

00:18:57.320 --> 00:18:59.070
and two tablespoons of sugar.

00:18:59.070 --> 00:19:01.320
One tablespoon of soy sauce,

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:03.690
and one tablespoon of mirin,

00:19:03.690 --> 00:19:05.000
then mix.

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:12.540
Then we take out the parts of 
the rice that haven't burnt.

00:19:15.840 --> 00:19:17.510
She's smooshing the rice!

00:19:18.500 --> 00:19:19.870
Is that sauce, too?

00:19:19.870 --> 00:19:21.000
It's mochi.

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:22.090
Mochi?

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:30.440
It looks like a dumpling!

00:19:37.190 --> 00:19:39.070
I wanna try!

00:19:39.070 --> 00:19:41.150
Sure. You can help me.

00:19:41.150 --> 00:19:42.030
Okay!

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:48.030
Now squish it.

00:19:48.030 --> 00:19:49.040
Okay!

00:19:49.880 --> 00:19:51.540
Squish, squish!

00:19:51.540 --> 00:19:53.370
Squish, squish...

00:19:56.950 --> 00:20:00.260
Sorry, can you show me how to do it, too?

00:20:01.860 --> 00:20:02.630
Okay!

00:20:03.400 --> 00:20:05.480
It's like clay, huh?

00:20:05.480 --> 00:20:06.980
It sure is.

00:20:07.360 --> 00:20:09.000
Kotori-chan, look!

00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:10.760
You're good at this!

00:20:15.340 --> 00:20:17.120
Let us do the grilling, okay?

00:20:17.120 --> 00:20:18.020
Okay!

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:19.880
Once the outside's cooked...

00:20:19.880 --> 00:20:20.530
Add sauce!

00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:22.440
We spread this on,

00:20:23.900 --> 00:20:25.240
and cook it some more.

00:20:29.310 --> 00:20:30.790
It smells good!

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:32.460
The sauce is charring...

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:35.500
It smells amazing!

00:20:35.960 --> 00:20:37.290
It's done!

00:20:43.890 --> 00:20:46.800
The smell makes my tummy rumble!

00:20:48.270 --> 00:20:50.520
It really does smell good!

00:20:50.780 --> 00:20:51.820
Okay...

00:20:51.820 --> 00:20:54.020
Let's eat!

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:02.190
This is good!

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:04.160
It's good!

00:21:04.160 --> 00:21:06.410
Yeah, it is!

00:21:09.640 --> 00:21:10.790
You've got some on you.

00:21:38.600 --> 00:21:40.960
Tsumugi, wake up!

00:21:40.960 --> 00:21:44.040
Breakfast this morning came out pretty good!

00:21:46.020 --> 00:21:47.350
Daddy...

00:21:49.120 --> 00:21:51.670
I'm glad you're better.

00:21:53.800 --> 00:21:54.950
Yup.

00:21:56.900 --> 00:21:58.090
Thanks.
